# Transporting (adoulin 82), the kind at Kongramm: a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin, SoA current
# A Curse from the Past (39, a GM: Kongramm's script plays 148), the quest accepted (a GM). Kongramm at Prog 0: 2592,
# finished: Prog 1; Prog 0 again (a GM): 2592 again (a progressEvent: his script would take an Event's second turn).
# Prog 1, no quest action: his default 558 (the handler's turn), his script's 148 (SOA_ACFTP_Kongramm 1), default 558.
lists WesternAdoulin/Kongramm/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2592
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=62.5,32,138 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Soa ACurseFromThePast current
quest Adoulin.Transporting accepted
login
trigger Kongramm                        # Prog 0: 2592
finish                                  # Prog 1
charvar Quest[9][82]Prog 0              # a GM
trigger Kongramm                        # Prog 0: 2592 again (not his script's 148)
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Kongramm                        # Prog 1, no quest action: default 558
finish-if-event
trigger Kongramm                        # his script's turn: 148
finish-if-event
trigger Kongramm                        # default 558
finish-if-event
